1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,731
Now Malus's law.

2
00:00:01,731 --> 00:00:09,778
Plane polarized light of amplitude A meets an analyser whose axis is at an angle theta to the vibrations.

3
00:00:09,778 --> 00:00:12,044
Split A into two parts.

4
00:00:12,044 --> 00:00:16,002
A cos theta, along the axis, gets through.

5
00:00:16,002 --> 00:00:19,960
A sine theta, across the axis, is absorbed.

